# ── C++ build ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
*.exe
*.obj
*.o
*.so
*.lib
*.dll

# ── Generated data & results (large; regenerate locally) ─────────────────────
# Ignore the bulk data (.npy price arrays, scenario CSVs, old logs) but KEEP the
# fetch/prep scripts that live under data/.
data/*
!data/*.py
logs/

